### Chat endpoint - valid request
POST http://localhost:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What's the best material for grip in cold ice rinks?"
}

### Chat endpoint - invalid request (empty message)
POST http://localhost:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": ""
}

